      }
    },
    {
      "text": "５ターンのあいだ　じめんにいると\nじょうたいいじょうに　ならず　ドラゴン\nわざの　ダメージも　はんぶんになる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "5턴 동안 땅에 있으면\n상태 이상이 되지 않고\n드래곤타입 기술의 데미지도 절반이 된다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在５回合內，\n地面上的寶可夢不會陷入異常狀態。\n龍屬性招式的傷害也會減半。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Pendant cinq tours, les Pokémon au sol ne peuvent\npas subir d’altération de statut et la puissance\ndes capacités de type Dragon est divisée par deux.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Schützt fünf Runden lang alle Pokémon, die den Boden\nberühren, vor Statusproblemen. Der erlittene Schaden\ndurch Drachen-Attacken wird halbiert.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Durante cinco turnos, los Pokémon que están en el\nsuelo no sufren problemas de estado y se reduce a la\nmitad el daño de los movimientos de tipo Dragón.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Per cinque turni il terreno entra nello stato di Campo\nNebbioso: i Pokémon a terra sono immuni ai problemi\ndi stato e la potenza delle mosse Drago è dimezzata.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This protects Pokémon on the ground from status\nconditions and halves damage from Dragon-type\nmoves for five turns.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "５ターンの　間　地面にいると\n状態異常に　ならず　ドラゴン技の\nダメージも　半分になる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在５回合内，\n地面上的宝可梦不会陷入异常状态。\n龙属性招式的伤害也会减半。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
